      "mode": "single",
      "independent_solution": "Starting from a_5 and advancing 2,11,35 places gives a_7=a_5*q^2, a_16=a_5*q^11, a_40=a_5*q^35. This is a forward recurrence identity, requiring no division by the anchor.",
